        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 8:4",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 8,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that the people came to him throughout all the borders of the land which was by the wilderness side. And they were baptized throughout all the land;",
        "footNotes": [],
