        "text": "Now Satan had gotten great hold upon the hearts of the people of the city of Ammonihah; therefore they would not hearken unto the words of Alma.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 27,
            "end": 31,
            "text": "2 Ne. 28:20 (19–22); D&C 10:20."
