        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 8,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "And behold, I am sent to command thee that thou return to the city of Ammonihah, and preach again unto the people of the city; yea, preach unto them. Yea, say unto them, except they repent the Lord God will destroy them.",
